{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"请解释 Transformer 的 Attention 机制，为什么比 RNN 更适合长序列？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"请解释 Transformer 的 Attention 机制，为什么比 RNN 更适合长序列？\" dir=\"auto\">请解释 Transformer 的 Attention 机制，为什么比 RNN 更适合长序列？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请解释 Transformer 的 Attention 机制，为什么它相比 RNN 更适合处理长序列？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、Attention 核心机制</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Attention 的本质是对序列中每个位置计算与其他所有位置的相关性权重，加权聚合信息：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> torch\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nn <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> nn\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> math\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">scaled_dot_product_attention</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Q<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> K<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> V<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> mask<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    Q: (batch, seq_len, d_k) - Query\n    K: (batch, seq_len, d_k) - Key\n    V: (batch, seq_len, d_v) - Value\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    d_k <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Q<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>size<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 计算注意力分数: score = QK^T / sqrt(d_k)</span>\n    scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>matmul<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Q<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> K<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>transpose<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sqrt<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>d_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 可选：应用 mask（如因果 mask）</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> mask <span class=\"token keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>masked_fill<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mask <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'-inf'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. Softmax 归一化得到注意力权重</span>\n    attn_weights <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>softmax<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> dim<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 加权求和 Value</span>\n    output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>matmul<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>attn_weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> V<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> attn_weights\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、Self-Attention vs Cross-Attention</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>Q 来源</th>\n<th>K/V 来源</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Self-Attention</td>\n<td>同一序列</td>\n<td>同一序列</td>\n<td>序列内部建模（Encoder）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cross-Attention</td>\n<td>解码器</td>\n<td>编码器</td>\n<td>连接两个序列（翻译、图文）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Masked Self-Attention</td>\n<td>同一序列（带mask）</td>\n<td>同一序列</td>\n<td>自回归生成（Decoder）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、相比 RNN 的三大优势</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">优势 1: 并行计算\nRNN: 必须顺序处理，t 时刻依赖 t-1 时刻\nAttention: 所有位置同时计算，训练速度差距数十倍\n\n优势 2: 长距离依赖\nRNN: 信息从位置 i 到 j 需要经过 |i-j| 步，梯度容易消失\nAttention: 任意两个位置直接连接，路径长度为 O(1)\n\n优势 3: 不存在梯度消失/爆炸\nRNN: 长序列下梯度连乘导致消失/爆炸\nAttention: 残差连接 + LayerNorm，梯度稳定\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、复杂度对比</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>每步计算</th>\n<th>序列长度</th>\n<th>并行度</th>\n<th>长距离依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>RNN</td>\n<td>O(d)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attention</td>\n<td>O(n^2·d)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>完全并行</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>Attention 的计算复杂度为 O(n^2)，长序列下内存和计算量爆炸。FlashAttention 通过 IO-Aware 分块计算，将内存从 O(n^2) 降到 O(n)，速度提升 2-4x。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Multi-Head Attention 的作用是什么？\"</strong> — 多个注意力头学习不同子空间的依赖关系，相当于 CNN 的多通道</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Attention 的 O(n^2) 复杂度如何优化？\"</strong> — FlashAttention、稀疏 Attention、线性 Attention、MQA/GQA</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"Attention 可以处理任意长度序列\" — O(n^2) 复杂度限制了实际可处理长度</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"Self-Attention 和 Attention 是一回事\" — Self-Attention 的 Q/K/V 来自同一序列</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}